    {
      "title": "Ask HN: What is the most useful thing AI has done for you?",
      "summary": "I had a deep conversation with a friend about what is the most useful thing AI has created/done for either of us. For my private life, AI helped me to diagnose and root caused a running toilet, and avoided the high cost of a plumber. It even help to select the replacement parts and how to replace them. Of course, on the tech side, AI is helping me build a healthcare company. What was yours?",
